    "CoiStatement": "Shinju Obara and Masahiro Murakawa received a speaker\u2019s honorarium from Maruishi Pharmaceutical CO., Ltd. (Osaka, Japan) which sells dexmedetomidine in Japan for delivering a lecture and for presiding at a meeting, respectively; the contents of the present study were not included in the lecture. All other authors have no Conflict of Interest to declare.",
    "Article": {
